% c048: 337-338 the hemiola cadence at the coda's peak is played by the bass and the middle as well as the tune (Aldwell-Schachter PDF 51-52, Ex. 3-8:
%   Mozart K. 283 puts the bass in the hemiola too): Vc, Cb, Cbsn, Bsn 1-2, violas, Tpt 1-2 (tutti rhythm) and timpani strike the three minims
